<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan industry Jan output falls 18 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Moldovan industry Jan output falls 18 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's industrial output in January was 18 percent lower than a year earlier, a report from the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION    Jan'97   Dec'96   Jan'96</p>
<p> Month-on-month pct change	    n/a	-6.4     -47.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year pct change	     -18.0     -8.5	+2.7</p>
<p>Note: January 1996 monthly change was not provided due to changes in calculation methodology, which made it incompatible with December data.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
